== diags.diag/switch-move-use-after
BYN2783 23:32 `items` borrows from what it was bound to and cannot be changed or moved
  label moving it would take the value out of what it borrows from
  help move or copy the value it was bound to instead
BYN2781 17:12 `r` is used after it was moved
  label moved on line 11
  help assign `r` a new value before using it again, or move a `.copy(to: alloc)` of it instead
